{
  "declaredLength": 3772,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "突如其来听我说！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7A81598251766765542C62118BF4FF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我发现了一个\n被挟持的精灵球。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621153D173B04E864E004E2A000A88AB631F630176847CBE70757403300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "被挟持？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "88AB631F6301FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那是什么？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A3662F4EC04E48FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那是闪焰队的研究内容之一啦。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n闪焰队曾经试图\n给精灵球传输计算机病毒，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n让球变得无法使用。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A3662F95EA7130961F768478147A7651855BB94E4B4E005566300200100001BE01000A95EA7130961F66FE7ECF8BD556FE000A7ED97CBE707574034F208F938BA17B97673A75C56BD2FF0C00100001BE00000A8BA9740353D85F9765E06CD54F7F7528300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这研究很不妙对吧？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n如果当时这项研究完成了，真不知道\n如今的卡洛斯地区会变成什么样子。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD978147A765F884E0D59995BF95427FF1F00100001BE01000A5982679C5F5365F68FD9987978147A765B8C62104E86FF0C771F4E0D77E59053000A59824ECA768453616D1B65AF5730533A4F1A53D862104EC04E4868375B50300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以呢，\n突如其来说正题！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE55462FF0C000A7A815982517667658BF46B639898FF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在这个被挟持的球里，\n有一只名叫<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>波尔凯尼恩<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>的宝可梦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "57288FD94E2A88AB631F63017684740391CCFF0C000A67094E0053EA540D53EB00100002FF0000066CE25C1451EF5C3C606900100002FF00000076845B9D53EF68A6300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "至于为什么这里会有被称为幻之宝可梦的\n波尔凯尼恩的球，那就是个谜了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "81F34E8E4E3A4EC04E488FD991CC4F1A670988AB79F04E3A5E7B4E4B5B9D53EF68A67684000A6CE25C1451EF5C3C606976847403FF0C90A35C31662F4E2A8C1C4E86300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "总而言之，我就是想帮忙把\n被关在里面的宝可梦放出来。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "603B800C8A004E4BFF0C62115C31662F60F35E2E5FD9628A000A88AB5173572891CC976276845B9D53EF68A6653E51FA6765300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "于是这里就轮到你出场了！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n等我把波尔凯尼恩从球里放出来之后，\n我希望你可以捉住它。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E8E662F8FD991CC5C318F6E52304F6051FA573A4E86FF0100100001BE01000A7B496211628A6CE25C1451EF5C3C60694ECE740391CC653E51FA67654E4B540EFF0C000A62115E0C671B4F6053EF4EE563494F4F5B83300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等你做好捕捉波尔凯尼恩的准备之后，\n就来和我说一声吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B494F60505A597D635563496CE25C1451EF5C3C6069768451C659074E4B540EFF0C000A5C316765548C62118BF44E0058F05427FF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你做好要捕捉波尔凯尼恩的\n觉悟……准备了吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60505A597D8981635563496CE25C1451EF5C3C60697684000A89C9609F2026202651C659074E865417FF1F00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "做好了！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "505A597D4E86FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF77B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "波尔凯尼恩在等着你哦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CE25C1451EF5C3C606957287B4977404F6054E6FF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "很～好很好！\n那我们就开始吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F88FF5E597D5F88597DFF01000A90A362114EEC5C315F0059CB5427300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不过其实现在有个问题。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n为了把波尔凯尼恩放出来，\n我去除了计算机病毒，<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n还做了一个可以不破坏球的结构\n就把球打开的装置，但是……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但是？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46662FFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我有不祥的预感",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621167094E0D796576849884611F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "波尔凯尼恩力大无穷，\n因此可以推测的是……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n把它从球里放出来的瞬间，\n它百分之一百会大闹一场！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CE25C1451EF5C3C6069529B592765E07A77FF0C000A56E06B6453EF4EE563A86D4B7684662F2026202600100001BE01000A628A5B834ECE740391CC653E51FA6765768477AC95F4FF0C000A5B83767E52064E4B4E00767E4F1A592795F94E00573AFF01FF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不过你放心吧！因为我叫了一位\n波尔凯尼恩的专家来。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8FC74F60653E5FC35427FF0156E04E3A621153EB4E864E004F4D000A6CE25C1451EF5C3C606976844E135BB66765300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "专家？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E135BB6FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有这么个人吗？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67098FD94E484E2A4EBA5417FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那个人就是我！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E2A4EBA5C31662F6211FF0100100002011400300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "跑遍密阿雷的每条街道的我\n走最短路线从密阿雷出版社跑过来了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8DD1904D5BC6963F96F776846BCF67618857905376846211000A8D70670077ED8DEF7EBF4ECE5BC6963F96F751FA7248793E8DD18FC767654E86FF0100100002011400300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "伊冯是密阿雷出版社的副主编，她手上\n有一份关于波尔凯尼恩的机密笔记哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F0A51AF662F5BC6963F96F751FA7248793E7684526F4E3B7F16FF0C5979624B4E0A000A67094E004EFD51734E8E6CE25C1451EF5C3C60697684673A5BC67B148BB054E6300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "根据机密笔记上写的\n它的力量的秘密……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n“如果它能够引发威力足以\n把整座山掀飞的水蒸气爆炸，<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n那么就可以合理推测……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n它的体内必定存在温度高到\n能将水分瞬间汽化的超高热器官。”<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "另外根据建国秘闻录记载……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n“在卡洛斯地区的西南部，\n有着将波尔凯尼恩<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n视为建国的宝可梦<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n并尊崇它的习俗。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n人们认为，他们所居住的平原\n是由于波尔凯尼恩引发的<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n水蒸气爆炸而形成的。”<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 12,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 111
    },
    {
      "displayText": "它的威力也太猛了吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B8376845A01529B4E5F592A731B4E865427FF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "毕竟在卡洛斯南部曾经发生过\n原因不明的大爆炸，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n导致巨大的山脉彻底消失了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6BD57ADF572853616D1B65AF535790E866FE7ECF53D1751F8FC7000A539F56E04E0D660E76845927720670B8FF0C00100001BE00000A5BFC81F45DE8592776845C7181095F7B5E956D8859314E86300200100002011400300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不管怎么想，\n那都是波尔凯尼恩造成的吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D7BA1600E4E4860F3FF0C000A90A390FD662F6CE25C1451EF5C3C60699020621076845427300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然我很犹豫要不要把它放出来，\n但我想把它放出来的心情没有变。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D713662115F8872B98C6B89814E0D8981628A5B83653E51FA6765FF0C000A4F46621160F3628A5B83653E51FA676576845FC360C56CA1670953D8300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以呢，\n我们就到研究所的地下室去吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE55462FF0C000A62114EEC5C31523078147A766240768457304E0B5BA453BB5427FF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿#",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00230000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n你应该听得到吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A4F605E948BE5542C5F9752305427FF1F00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我和伊冯会在房间外面\n为你奋斗的英姿加油助威的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211548C4F0A51AF4F1A5728623F95F459169762000A4E3A4F60594B6597768482F159FF52A06CB952A95A017684FF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "毕竟待在同一个房间里太危险了嘛。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6BD57ADF5F855728540C4E004E2A623F95F491CC592A537196694E86561B300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那么，你就把我刚才交给你的那个\n里面有波尔凯尼恩的球投出去吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E48FF0C4F605C31628A6211521A624D4EA47ED94F60768490A34E2A000A91CC976267096CE25C1451EF5C3C606976847403629551FA53BB5427FF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "波尔凯尼恩……果然看起来像是要\n大闹一场啊。那你就加油把它捉住吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CE25C1451EF5C3C606920262026679C7136770B8D77676550CF662F8981000A592795F94E00573A554A300290A34F605C3152A06CB9628A5B8363494F4F5427FF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "波噢噢～噢！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CE256625662FF5E5662FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿*",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是叫你捉住它啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211662F53EB4F6063494F4F5B83554AFF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "锵锵～！\n勇者漂亮地捉住了波尔凯尼恩！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 3008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "95359535FF5EFF01000A52C780056F024EAE573063494F4F4E866CE25C1451EF5C3C6069FF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不管是什么样的宝可梦，只要被捉住以后\n都会变得老实，真是神奇呀。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 3056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D7BA1662F4EC04E48683776845B9D53EF68A6FF0C53EA898188AB63494F4F4EE5540E000A90FD4F1A53D85F9780015B9EFF0C771F662F795E59475440300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿/",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 3132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看过了幻之宝可梦战斗的样子，\n直到现在我的身心都还在发抖。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 3144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B8FC74E865E7B4E4B5B9D53EF68A662186597768468375B50FF0C000A76F4523073B05728621176848EAB5FC390FD8FD8572853D16296300200100002011400300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我有件事想拜托你。\n只要让波尔凯尼恩把密阿雷那些<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n杂七杂八的东西都掀飞，马拉松就……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 3212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621167094EF64E8B60F362DC62584F603002000A53EA89818BA96CE25C1451EF5C3C6069628A5BC6963F96F790A34E9B00100001BE00000A67424E036742516B76844E1C897F90FD638098DEFF0C9A6C62C9677E5C312026202600100002011400300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你别太过分了啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 3312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60522B592A8FC752064E86554AFF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我当然是开玩笑的，不过这下我应该\n可以写出一篇不输给主编的报道了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 3340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115F537136662F5F0073A97B117684FF0C4E0D8FC78FD94E0B62115E948BE5000A53EF4EE5519951FA4E007BC74E0D8F937ED94E3B7F16768462A590534E86FF0100100002011400300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那我就跑着回密阿雷出版社了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 3416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A362115C318DD1774056DE5BC6963F96F751FA7248793E4E86FF0100100002011400300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "肯定还有其他因为闪焰队犯的错\n而被剥夺了自由的个体吧……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我自己也是名为代理所长的笼中之鸟。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 3456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "80AF5B9A8FD8670951764ED656E04E3A95EA7130961F72AF76849519000A800C88AB5265593A4E8681EA753176844E2A4F5354272026202600100001BE00000A621181EA5DF14E5F662F540D4E3A4EE374066240957F76847B3C4E2D4E4B9E1F300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但获得了你这个新搭档的\n波尔凯尼恩就不一样了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 3564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4683B75F974E864F608FD94E2A65B0642D68637684000A6CE25C1451EF5C3C60695C314E0D4E0068374E86300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "今后它可以和你一起\n做很多有趣的事情，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n毕竟训练家就是干这个的嘛。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 3620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4ECA540E5B8353EF4EE5548C4F604E008D77000A505A5F88591A67098DA376844E8B60C5FF0C00100001BE00000A6BD57ADF8BAD7EC35BB65C31662F5E728FD94E2A7684561B300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我也是多亏了你们\n才见证了有趣的事情。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 3704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E5F662F591A4E8F4E864F604EEC000A624D89C18BC14E8667098DA376844E8B60C5300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "拜拜～！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 3752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62DC62DCFF5EFF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    }
